# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for Clothbound.
#
# Intentionally EMPTY: Clothbound establishes exact happens-before edges across
# uninstrumented system libQt6Core QThreadPool handoffs via src/formats/tsanhandoff.h
# (__tsan_release / __tsan_acquire on the QRunnable* boundary, zero-overhead in
# non-TSan builds) and native std::mutex / std::condition_variable synchronization,
# so ZERO suppression rules are needed and NO real data race in any Clothbound
# lambda, runnable, or subsystem can ever be silently masked.
